# Optional, but set it before you show this to anyone.
#
# Without a token GitHub allows 60 API requests an hour from your server's IP,
# and mapping one repository spends two of them. A token with NO scopes ticked
# (public read only) raises the ceiling to 5,000 an hour.
#
# Make one at https://github.com/settings/tokens?type=beta
GITHUB_TOKEN=

# Required before Codarc can draft changes. Without it the map still works,
# but "Draft the change" returns a clear "not set up yet" message.
# Get one at https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional. While Codarc is pre-launch, set this to lock "Draft the change" to
# you alone — every draft costs real money and you don't want a stranger
# spending it. Make it long and random.
#
# Unlock yourself once by visiting:
#   https://your-domain/api/unlock?key=THE-SAME-VALUE
#
# Leave it empty and drafting is open to everyone.
CODARC_OWNER_KEY=
